l (refined)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="24" width="4128" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sub" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#9aa0b4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" value="Nine pillars. Geometry is IMDF/IFC-aligned and keeps stable feature keys across floor-plan revisions (RevisionMapping), so assignments and bookings survive a re-import. Allocation is a versioned event between Bookable and Bookings; Rules govern allocation, booking and check-in. References to Person, Group and Role are written in the cards (→) rather than drawn. Each relation is coloured by the pillar it starts from. Integration is what crosses the boundary (sync, devices, exports, API access); Events &amp;amp; history is what happened and who is told. Grey dashed = spaceweave-owned, not offered by any surveyed vendor." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="54" width="4128" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg0" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#3b82f6;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1580" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg0t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e6e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" value="Places &amp; geometry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="1580" width="123" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#8b5cf6;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="191" y="1580" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e6e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" value="Bookable" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="217" y="1580" width="60" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#2ee6c5;" value="" verte